(6474642, 962826, 59796, '<td valign="top">I suspect you might be william88, but in case you aren''t, possibly the best picture I''ve seen of this sort is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59267" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">william88</a>''s "Momentary Sculpture" <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=830224" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1104/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_830224.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1104/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_830224.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1104/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_830224.jpg"/></a>. <br/> <br/>Here, you have the red water doing very well against green backdrop, and the full bubble floating around is just amazing timing. The only thing keeping me from giving a 10 is that the picture feels a little unbalanced - there should be a bit more on the left side and chop of a little bit more on the right side. Still, I hope you ribbon.</td>', 'I suspect you might be william88, but in case you aren''t, possibly the best picture I''ve seen of this sort is  william88''s "Momentary Sculpture" .  Here, you have the red water doing very well against green backdrop, and the full bubble floating around is just amazing timing. The only thing keeping me from giving a 10 is that the picture feels a little unbalanced - there should be a bit more on the left side and chop of a little bit more on the right side. Still, I hope you ribbon.', '2011-07-18 19:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
