(6474679, 962830, 59796, '<td valign="top">A very delicate image with sensual color combination. Love the drop and it''s pattern magnification. I even like the light source reflection in the drop. Would''ve loved some more breathing space around the feather, but I understand this is a macro challenge. The little bit of noise in the whites and the central placement of the drop are keeping me from scoring this even higher.</td>', 'A very delicate image with sensual color combination. Love the drop and it''s pattern magnification. I even like the light source reflection in the drop. Would''ve loved some more breathing space around the feather, but I understand this is a macro challenge. The little bit of noise in the whites and the central placement of the drop are keeping me from scoring this even higher.', '2011-07-18 20:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6474681, 962377, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! It''s fabulous that there are no reflections on any of the flat module surfaces. My top5 in this challenge. Also, I hope you have the permission to post this image in public.</td>', 'Beautiful! It''s fabulous that there are no reflections on any of the flat module surfaces. My top5 in this challenge. Also, I hope you have the permission to post this image in public.', '2011-07-18 20:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
