(6475152, 962685, 28427, '<td valign="top">I like the game you play between positive and negative space.<br/>The eye has to be blurred since the main subject is the ear.  But...the sharpness should have been on the ear then IMHO.  Your point of sharpness looks to be placed just before and below the ear.  Now, the ear being part of a baby, I suppose baby couldn''t sit still.</td>', 'I like the game you play between positive and negative space.The eye has to be blurred since the main subject is the ear.  But...the sharpness should have been on the ear then IMHO.  Your point of sharpness looks to be placed just before and below the ear.  Now, the ear being part of a baby, I suppose baby couldn''t sit still.', '2011-07-19 08:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
