(6476934, 962777, 125275, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF, such a nice point of focus 1/3 down the button. It leaves me wondering what the button is thinking. Perhaps it misses its old home, the jacket, but enjoys its new, still life on the ground.</td>', 'I love the DOF, such a nice point of focus 1/3 down the button. It leaves me wondering what the button is thinking. Perhaps it misses its old home, the jacket, but enjoys its new, still life on the ground.', '2011-07-20 14:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476935, 962705, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like this because it''s so clear against the white background. Plus that old rusty pipe adds to the richness of the overall colors.</td>', 'I like this because it''s so clear against the white background. Plus that old rusty pipe adds to the richness of the overall colors.', '2011-07-20 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476937, 962773, 125275, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool shot. It''s amazing how this stuff exists in nature, but if we were to try to create this it would almost be its own miracle if we could. Nice capture and DOF.</td>', 'That''s a cool shot. It''s amazing how this stuff exists in nature, but if we were to try to create this it would almost be its own miracle if we could. Nice capture and DOF.', '2011-07-20 14:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476938, 962403, 125275, '<td valign="top">Quenched.<br/>I really like the grittyness and overall clarity. I also think this is an image where the B&amp;W really adds to the image. This is quality that budweiser would use for an ad!</td>', 'Quenched.I really like the grittyness and overall clarity. I also think this is an image where the B&W really adds to the image. This is quality that budweiser would use for an ad!', '2011-07-20 14:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6476939, 962074, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the bright blue of this. I also like this macro because it''s a close up on an everyday object, and provides a view we don''t normally have.</td>', 'I like the bright blue of this. I also like this macro because it''s a close up on an everyday object, and provides a view we don''t normally have.', '2011-07-20 14:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
