(6476941, 962484, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like this. The softness of the smoke and how the colors complement each other. I like how even in a close up of the candle, you were still able to use negative space.</td>', 'I like this. The softness of the smoke and how the colors complement each other. I like how even in a close up of the candle, you were still able to use negative space.', '2011-07-20 14:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
