(6477992, 962022, 29777, '<td valign="top">cool. I like this type of shot even better with a dark back ground the really makes the highlights pop. I really like the multiple drops inside the bubble. Well done.</td>', 'cool. I like this type of shot even better with a dark back ground the really makes the highlights pop. I really like the multiple drops inside the bubble. Well done.', '2011-07-21 20:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
