(6480966, 962357, 59796, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon!<br/>Technically well done. Might''ve placed even higher if there were no light box reflection in the water.<br/> <br/>Reminded me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=4226" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Gaurawa</a>''s shot: <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=523181" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/688/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_523181.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/688/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_523181.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/688/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_523181.jpg"/></a> <br/>which in turn was inspired by a picture posted on BBC.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-25 14:57:53.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon!Technically well done. Might''ve placed even higher if there were no light box reflection in the water. Reminded me of  Gaurawa''s shot:  which in turn was inspired by a picture posted on BBC.', '2011-07-25 15:57:02.000000', '2011-07-25 15:57:53.000000', 0),
(6481038, 962826, 75713, '<td valign="top">Somehow I missed leaving a comment on this - I think I was just overwhelmed at it''s complexity and beauty.  <br/> <br/>I have never tried to do one of these because I know it''s way beyond my abilities. <br/> <br/>No matter how many times this type of photo has been done, it''s like landscapes, I never grow tired of seeing how each photographer create their own unique take on the subject. <br/> <br/>Congratulations on this masterpiece and your ribbon.</td>', 'Somehow I missed leaving a comment on this - I think I was just overwhelmed at it''s complexity and beauty.   I have never tried to do one of these because I know it''s way beyond my abilities.  No matter how many times this type of photo has been done, it''s like landscapes, I never grow tired of seeing how each photographer create their own unique take on the subject.  Congratulations on this masterpiece and your ribbon.', '2011-07-25 18:21:48.000000', NULL, 0),
