(6481549, 962742, 104933, '<td valign="top">I saw this picture when the challenge started, and thought it was mine for a second, had to do a double take!  The naming was even relatively close!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=962815" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1421/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_962815.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1421/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_962815.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1421/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_962815.jpg"/></a> <br/>I think the focus on yours is WAY better than mine, but I think yours is a little dark, and slightly over-sharpened.<br/>Nonetheless, I like it, and I can only imagine our cats might be twins!</td>', 'I saw this picture when the challenge started, and thought it was mine for a second, had to do a double take!  The naming was even relatively close! I think the focus on yours is WAY better than mine, but I think yours is a little dark, and slightly over-sharpened.Nonetheless, I like it, and I can only imagine our cats might be twins!', '2011-07-26 15:29:11.000000', NULL, 0),
