(6481861, 962331, 70484, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments. We were at the Sonora Desert Museum and they have this large hummingbird aviary. It''s so cool. They fly right up to you and you can walk up to them (not that they sit for long). I even found some little nests, but no eggs or birds in them. It was my favorite part of the whole museum! I could have spent all day just in that one exhibit.</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments. We were at the Sonora Desert Museum and they have this large hummingbird aviary. It''s so cool. They fly right up to you and you can walk up to them (not that they sit for long). I even found some little nests, but no eggs or birds in them. It was my favorite part of the whole museum! I could have spent all day just in that one exhibit.', '2011-07-26 23:27:55.000000', NULL, 0),
