(6530525, 962632, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wicked. I believe they are as unique as a fingerprint. <br/>How do yo find the IQ on the Sigma 180mm? I have one and it is great but naturally heavy to hand hold. Any experience with the Sigma 150mm F2.8 EX APO DG HSM Macro version yet? At 895g it''s slightly lighter by 50g (945g) so it''s still quite a chunk of glass. Would you switch if you had the chance? Regards, Harvey.</td>', 'Wicked. I believe they are as unique as a fingerprint. How do yo find the IQ on the Sigma 180mm? I have one and it is great but naturally heavy to hand hold. Any experience with the Sigma 150mm F2.8 EX APO DG HSM Macro version yet? At 895g it''s slightly lighter by 50g (945g) so it''s still quite a chunk of glass. Would you switch if you had the chance? Regards, Harvey.', '2011-09-06 18:27:20.000000', NULL, 0),
